<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">1 T'imotiwos</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 T'imotiwos</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 T'imotiwos Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 T'im.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Shints Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">T'imotiwos Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">T'imotiwosi eteets jawets na'o krstiyano Esiyi datsatse b́teshor, induwereron Ayhudi datsi asha, niho weeronmó Grik dats asha b́tesh, P'awlossh karntso b́ tohonat doo shishi finoshowere karnon bish tep'foni b́ tesh, P'awlos T'imotiwossh b́ guut'ts wosho shintso keez keewu een eenuwotsatsa b́ kitsir.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jamoniyere shino b́woshotse b́daniyruwo Ik'i mootse tuut teshts kooti danatse boatso bokotetuwok'owa b́tesh, ib wotts danman b́ bado ayhudiwotska, b́ badonmó k'osh naari ashuwots hasabiyo b́ gitsotse detsts wotat, «Be'eyiru datsan morron baad'ewutsk b́ wottsotse kasho daatso falet k'osh wotts weeron ááshts danonat ik ik naari mishuwtsnat de'eyatse bíats kotonee» eti asaabiyatse te'eeka b́ tesh. Manats dabt b́ woshotse Ik'i maa k'eezi jangonat Ik' mangiy jangosh nemona, aani Ik'i maa jishiruwotsnat boon teú'awots detset boon geyit amalo kitsituwoniye. B́ s'uwaatsnowere T'imotiwos Iyesus Krstosko doo guutso awuk'o wottso bín b́ geyituwok'onat b́ beyiru ay ashuwotsoke bín s'iilit keewotse aatewotse P'awlos bísh b́ iztso datsituwone.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">B tuwo 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik' moonat b́ guutsuwots jango 1:3—3:16</para>
  <para style="io1">T'imotiwossh b́ fini jangosh imets dano 4:1—6:21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Ik'o no atoke no nojangtso Iyesus Krstos tzaziyon woshek wottso P'awlosoke.<verse eid="1TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Wosh. 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Imnetiyon ari t naayi wottso T'imotiyossh, Ik'o nonihokere, nodoonz Iyesus Krstosoke s'aatonat mihretiyonu, jenonu neesh wotowe.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kooti danatse boatso bokotetuwok'o b́ k'altsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Mek'edoniy maants tiamor neesh oona ti ettsok'on, manoke fa'a ash ik ikuwots kooti dano bodanirawok'o nwoshish Efesonitse beewe. <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Tururonat s'uu deshaw naar taawo maants k'ayr boanerawok'o boon azazowe, keewanots moosha bodoweti bako amanon fineyiru Ik'i finosh t'ak'ameratsnee. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Tzaziyanmó nib s'ayinotse, asaabi s'ayinon, arik wotts amanon daatsets shunoniye. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Ik ik ashuwots keewanotsatse k'aleyat k'awunts deshaw moosho maants k'az anernee. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Man bok'aluwere nemo daniyruwotsi woto geeyatniye, wotowabako bokeewiruwo danatsne, arkeewetsnone boetirwono t'iwintsratsne.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Asho geyitsok'on bín b́finiyal nemo sheeng b́wottsok'o danfone. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Mank'owa nemo ned'iye ash kááwuwots b́woterawk'o danfone, nemo beeze mishetswotsnat k'uur finetsuwotsshe, Ik'osh k'erawwotsnat morr finetsuwotsshe, s'ayin woterawwotsnat kash keewo gac'iruwotsshe, bonihonat bo indon úd'iru kash úd'iruwots, <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>Widetswotsna, g'ad'wotsnat, asho up'dek'amt kemiru jaktswotsnat kootetswotsi, kooton taarirwotsnat arik wotts dano k'uriru keew jamo finiruwotsshe. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>Arik wotts danonmó b́ daatset mangiyets Ik'o b́ shishits mangts doo shishiyone, doo shishiyanwere taash adar imetsoniyee.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Ik'o oorowe eti jangosh b́t'intsts udo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Finosh taan amanetso woshde naashiyosh taawdek't imtso nodoonz Iyesus Krstosi udirwe. <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>Dab haniyere shin Krstosi c'ashtsonat gishtso, ketitso twotiyalor, bí taash mhretiyo b́woshi, bíwere taash mhretiyan b́wosh taa jaman t k'al daronat aman tk'aztsatse tuutson b́ teshtsotsne. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Noo Ik'o s'aato Iyesus Krstosn nok wotts imnetiyonat t shunonton s'eent ooytso taash imere. <verse eid="1TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>«Iyesus Krstos morr finetswotsi kashiwosh datsats waare» etiru aap'o arikonat ash jamo dek'o bin b́ geyit keewe, morrets jamuwotsitsnor bítsi bog morretso taane. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Ernmó taash mihretiyow oshere, taash mhretiyo woshere Iyesus Krstos ayidek't ayts b́ k'amoon ashe dash morretso wottsosh tiatse kitsosh bín amanitsuwotsnat dúre dúri kash datsituwotssh sheeng artso t wotishee. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Mansh dúre dúri Nugúsosh, k'irrawosh, be'erawosh, Ik'o Izar Izewersh mangonat udon bísh dúre dúrosh wotowe! Amen.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>T naayi T'imotiwoso! haniyere shin njangosh bek'on keewetsok'on azazets adaranotsi neesh imetuwe, bek'mann jisheyar kes'i sheengo kec'ee, <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>Amanonat maac' s'ayinetso wotowe, ash ik ikuwots bonibo bojuutsatse tuutson markabo jongon b́t'ffok'o bo imnetiyo t'afs'uure. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Boyitse Hemenewosnat t Iskndrn fa'enee, boowere Ik' c'ash aap'o keewo k'azo bo danetwok'o Shed'anosh beshidek'at imik'rere.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ik' mootsi Ik' k'ono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Jamoniyere shino Ik'o ik'iyonat mangon s'eents beyi k'onon, sagadon, koshuwotssh Ik' k'ononat udona ash jamosh k'aletwok'owe ti iziri. <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>Ik' shatonat sheeng amalon jisheyar jeenonat s'k err no beetwok'o jamotsere nugúsuwotsnat een een dats k'eeziru naash jamwotssh Ik'o k'onwere. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Hanuwere noon kashitso Ik'o shinatse shengwonat bín geneúshit keewe. <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>Ik' shuno ash jamwots kasharr aronowere bo danetwok'owe. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Ik'o ike, dagotse wotde'e Ik'onat ashon manituwonu ike, bíwere ash wottso Iyesus Krstosiye. <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>Ash jamo morrotse kishosh b́ tooko beshidek't imtso bíne, hanuwere aron bí aaw man b́ bodor Ik'o kashiy fino noosh kitsit gawoniye. <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>Taa imnetiyonat aron doo shishiyosh wosheetsonat danifon wotat Ik' danaw ashuwotsok t woshe man jangoshe, han tietor ara tkeewiri bako kooratse.<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Eshe b́ be beyoke fa'a nungshwots fayonat shit'on k'ayr bo kishi s'aynman dambaan k'aúde Ik'o bo k'onitwok'owe t geyiri. <verse eid="1TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/>Máátswotswere took s'iir wozewon wee awnts wee ink'uwon wee shawu gizon keewets tahon baatso b́woterawo jiitsonat botoko dashan detson wotts ash na'i taho tahde'ene. <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>Ik'o mangiyirwone etts máátswots k'alo boosh b́ geyit sheeng finon baatsunee. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Máátsu s'ik etonat azazewo daniye. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Máátsu nungusho b daniyituwok'o wee nungushatse bialituwok'owa eraatse, biye s'ik eto bish geyife. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Shino azeetso Adamiye, ilowere azetsu Hewaniyee. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Ando ant'elcetsunat Ik'i nemo gaktsunu máátsuni bako ant'elcetso Adamiyaliye. <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Ernmó máátsu amanonat shunon s'ayinonowere kup'arr biatso koton bbetkawotyal na'a shuwon kashituwaniye.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ep'is k'op'isiwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Ash iko ep'is k'op'isiyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ep'is k'op'isiyo: </char><char style="ft">Ik' ashuwotsi jishiruwoniye. </char></note> «woto b́ geyyale sheeng fine b́ tewni» etiru aap'o arikee <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Eshe Ep'is k'op'isi iko, bí atse k'efetuwo deshawo, mááts ik s'uzu dek'tso, bí angok'on betuwo, b́ took keewiruwo, teron finituwo, ib dek'etwo, daniyosh faltuwo, <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>Másherawo, moosho shunawo, maac' nef wottso, fayetsi woterawo, giz shunawo, <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>B́ took moowo k'ezdek'o falituwo, b́ nanauwots mangon bísh aleyirwotsi woto geyituwe. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>B́ took moo k'ezdek'o falatse wotiyal asho Ik' mootsi ashuwotsi ak'aldeniya k'eezo b́ faliti? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Dayablos bog taana eton fugeyat bí ats angshetsok'o karnon amantso bí ats angsherawok'o Ep'is k'opisiyo wotk'aye. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2-7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tito 1:6-9</ref></char></note> B́ shútso b́ t'afre Shed'ani kamboots kindr b́ dihirawok'o amaneraw ashuwotsoke sheeng shútso detstso woto bín geyiyituwe.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Diyak'oniyots jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Diyak'oniwotswere mank'o mangiyetswotsnat ik alberets wottsuwotsi, weyiniyon dutsets biro ay uyawwotsi, gizoshowere ayide'er k'awntirwotsi woto geyiratse, <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>Ando imnetiy mist'iryo nib s'ayinon koto boosh geyituwe, <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Bowere shino fadewne, maniyakonowere boatse s'iilr eegonor bo atse datserawwotsi wotarr bodatseyal diyak'oni fino finone. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Aaninuwere bomáátswotswor mangiyetswotsi, ash oonerawwotsi, bo angok'on beyirwotsi, jam keewon amanetswotsi woto boosh geyife. <verse eid="1TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Diyak'oniwots botook tookosh mááts iku kenih woto boosh geyife, bo nana'onat bo maa asho sheengsh detsonat k'eezo boon geyfe. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Diyak'oni fino sheengeshde finitwots een ma'aregiyo daatsitune, Iyesus Krstosn wotts imnetiyo ááwu shuk'on keewo falituee.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14-15"/>Karn aawotse weetuwe tietalorni, daneraka wook'ayr t teshetkawotiyala dure duron beyiruwo Ik'o moonat aron k'ons'ets irok'o Ik'i mootse asho awuk'o k'alo bín b́ geyituwok'o n danetuwok'o neen jishituwo neesh guut'etuwe. <verse eid="1TI 3:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Noo haymanoti mist'iriyo hake baka eterawok'on eene, bíwere Ik'o</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">«Ash wotat be'ere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">ar b́ wottsok'o shayiron b́dani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Melakiwotssho b́ be'eyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">Ash jamosh nabere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">datsatsi ash jamo bín boamani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">mangon daro maantsan b́ dek'eyi» etke.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Koot daniyo danifuwotse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>S'ayn shayironmo kishidek't hank'o bí eti, «Dúr s'uwatsere ik ik ashuwots shelit shairwootsnat fo'erawwots danits dani jafrats sha'ar bo haymanotiyo haalitwune.» <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Han naari danan b́ t'up'ir bo ats danawwotsoknee, koto bokeworo biri k'ees'on mitsetsok'o wotat dungwtsts bo nibotse boosh shiyeraw ashuwotsokne. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Hannk'o ashuwtswere de'ewo bo baziri, amantsuwotsnat ar dants ashuwots Ik'o mangifetsre bometuwok'o Ik'o boosh bí imts misho «Maak'ayere» ett bo baziyiri. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Ik' azts jamo sheenge, udon deek'etkaa wotiyal eegoru juwet keewo aaliye. <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>Ik' aap'onat Ik' k'onon s'aynk wotituwe.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstossh sheeng guutso woti jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Daniyan amantsuwotssh n danetka wotiyal imnetiyi aap'onat b́ shuuts n shairu sheeng danman danfetsat eentso, Iyesus Krstossh guuts sheengo wotitune. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Ik' mangiyo bíyitse aalts datsanatsi turur keewatse wokowe Ik' ik'iyosh n tooko daniwe. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Nmets atson n atso kup'iyosh ntook k'aniyo muk' keewoshe neesh b́ t'ak'amiti, ernmó Ik' mangiyosh ntooko k'aniyonmo andonat shino maantsi weet kashosh nojangiruwo b́ wottsosh jamosh noosh t'ak'amituwe. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Eteets etanuwere ash jamo b́ dek'et arik wotts keewoniye. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Noowere ash jamo kashituwon bítsnowere amants jamwotsi kashiti jamaawo beet Ik'on no jangirwosh finon no mawiri, nomak'oriri.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Keewanotsno azazowe, daniwe, <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Jawets n wottsosh konuworu neen gac'k'aye, maniyere n keewon, n beyon, n shunon, n imnetiyonat s'ayn n woton amants jamwotssh sheengon ariyetso wotowe. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Taa t wafetsosh s'ayn mas'aafwotsi ash ashuwotssh nababon, nabonat daniyon kup'owe. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Bek'on nesh keeweworat Ik' máá eenashuwots bokisho niats bogedori kash s'aynon neesh imets im man batk'aye. <verse eid="1TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Eenfere niamok'o ash jamo b bek'etwok'o keewu jamanotsats kup'owe, keewu jamanotsi finats jitsr n jamon keewon boosh ime. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>N tokonat n daniru finonsh niatso korde'e, keewanotsatso kup'owe, hank'o k'alon n tokonat neen k'ebiruwotsi kashitune.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s">T'oow máátswots jangosh izets izo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Ash eeno nihok'o woshde izuwe bako fayk'aye, jawetsono eshuwotskok'owa, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>Gaawer máátsuwotsno indok'o woshde s'iile, baruwotsno mish mishuwotsk'o woshde s'aynon boon s'iile.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Arikon bo keniho bo atse k'irts máátswotsi mangiwe <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>B keniho bí'atse k'irts mááatsu nana'otsi wee b na'i na'o b detsal nana'a manots shino bo maa ashuwotssh k'alo b́ geyituwo k'alune, bo indonat nihon bo indowonat aboowonsh gusho aaniwosh kash weeron fin boon gyituwo danne, manuwere Ik' gene'ushit keewe. <verse eid="1TI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Bi aal beyiru t'owu mááts wottsu, b tewuno Ik'ats woshde t'uwe aawo Ik'o bin b́ tep'etuwok'o Ik' k'onon kup'arr betuwaniye. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Datsanatsi gene'ú mec'ro shunts t'oow máátsunmó bihe need'on k'irkiye. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Bo atse gondo daatseraniyere bo beetuewk'o dananotsi boosh daniwe. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>B́ took jaguwotssh, bítsnor bomeyitsi ashuwotsi gawrawo bí b́ imnetiyo k'azkee, dab́ amaneraw ashuwotsiyeror iki gondefe.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Keez ub natoniyere dash wotts bkenih k'irts máátsu t'oowo máátsuwots shúúts guut'eyru mezgebiyats guut'k'aye, dabnwor ik kenihosh amts máátsu woto bin geytuwe. <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>Dabrnu nana'uwotsi shengshde ditson, ib dek'on, s'aynwots tufo mashon, kic'tswotsi tepon sheeng fin jamo k'alosh sheeng fin jamo finosh kup'tsu woto bish geytuwe.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Bo kenih k'irts máatswotsitse enasherafa'úwots bo mets tewuno boon da'a b́de'e, Krstossh bo detsts shuno b́shapre mááts amo bo geyituwotse boon t'owu máátsuwotsi mazgabets mazabiyats guut'k'aye. <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>Máátsanots shin Krstossh bokindts taareo bogaktsotsnowere botokats angshe bodowiri. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Ando aani final beyo bodaneti, finl be mec'ro b́ woteftsere ash maa moots gúrar asho bo oniti, ash keewots bo kiniditi, keewosh boon geyira keewo bokeewiti. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Hanshowere enasheraw t'owu máátswots máátso amr na'o bo shuwitwok'o, bo moono shengshde bo k'ezituwok'o, izituwe, hank'on t'elato boshútso t'afiyosh weerindo datsatse. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Haniyere shinoru bo kenihi k'irts t'owu mááts ik ikuwots imneti weratse tuut Shed'ani shuutso sha'erne. <verse eid="1TI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Amants mááts iku meyitsere bo kenihi k'irts máátsuwots fa'ane wotiyal Ik' meyitsi ashuwotssh kur bowoterawok'o bíwere boon teúwiye, hank'onowere Ik' moow eegoru boon tep'etu deshaw bokenihi k'irts t'owu máátsuwotsi tep'o falfane.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Ik' mootsi fino sheengshdek't jishiruwotsi, dabnu nabonat daniyonmawiru een ashuwotssh git kish wotts mango boosh geyife, <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>S'ayn mas'aafotse «Mááyo sirbiru minzi beero b́ no no tipk'aye,» mank'o «fintsosh damozo daats bísh geyiyfe» etre. <verse eid="1TI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Wee gito wee keez asho b́ gawiyala bako Ik' meyitsi ashuwotsi jishiru eenashats t'intseyiru s'aamiyo dek'k'aye. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>K'osh k'osh ashuwots boshatetwok'o morro finiru ashuwotsi ash jamwots shinatse giishowe.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>N finiru keew jamon iko ikoniyere n bogshrawo t iztsank'on jamo ik aawon ns'iletwok'o Ik'onat Iyesus Krstosn marat'ets melakiwots shinatse adaran neesh imre <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>N kisho ashuwotsats gerde boosh k'onr naashiwosh kark'aye, k'osh ashuwots morro nkayerawok'o n tooko s'aynon kord'e.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>N maac' weeshonat jam aawo n shodiruwi jangosh múk'shde weyiniyon dutsets biro úyee bako haniye okoon aats mec'ro ushk'aye.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Ik ik ashuwots mrro be'ek b́ woto shin angshoniye b́kitsiri, k'osh ashuwots morro b́ be'et ja'arniye. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Sheeng fino jamoshe b́ be'eti, aashat beyirwonwor be'eraniyere ooreratse.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="s">Guutsuwotssh imets izo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Ik' shútsonat b́ danits danon b́ c'asherawok'o guuts guuts jamwots bo doonzotsi mangiyo boosh b́ geyituwok'owo dande'ene. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Bodoonzots amank wotts doonz detsts guuts jamwots Iyesus Krstosn bo eshuwotsi bo wottsotse boon gac'k'ayine, bo fin manatse oot' datsituwots bo doonz doonzuwots amantsonat shuneets eshuu bowottsosh baltsoniye bogshide' boosh finone. Neewere daniyonat izon neen b́geyit haniye.<verse eid="1TI 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kot daniyonat arik wotts gaalon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Arikon Ik' k'eyi jango daniru danmanton ik wottso no doonz Iyesus Krstos aap'oman k'azt k'osh dan danyiru asho b́ beyal, <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>man kofangirwonat b́jamon danawoniye, wotowabako mooshonat wed'eyon bíatsots gond tewuno s'eenb́gutsi, man b́ dowetwere okoora, faya, c'asha, amank'aza, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>Botooko kimt arikeewo boyitse t'afts ashuwots bofinefo k'ut'eraw mooshoniye, hank'o ashuwotssh Ik'osh k'ewo gizdatsi malee bí arefoni.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>«T detstso taash bodfe» etiru ashosh Ik' ik'iyoash woto ay oot'o daatsituwe. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Datsanats dek'nowaatso eegor aaliye, datsatsnowere eegoru de'e no amet keewo aaliye. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>No meetuwonat no tahituwon nodatsitkawotiyal noosh bodfe. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Gaaletsi wotosh geyiruwotsmó fadewon dihitúne, ash ashuwotsi awaashituwonat t'afiytu k'awuntsdeshaw gond keewon ay tewuni kambon deshetunee. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Han b́ wotitwonwere gizi shuno gond jamwotssh t'up' b́ wottsi jangoshe.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos T'imotiyossh bí imts izonat tzaziyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Ik' ashono! Neho jamanotsatse k'ayi woc'e, kááwon, Shayiri ash woton, imnetiyon, shunon, k'amonowere kup'ar, maac' nefon sha'owe. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Imnetiyon sheeng kaaro kaarowe, neen b́ maantsan b́ s'eegor ay wotts gawuwots shinatse ar wotts gawo ni imtso dúre dúri kasho deshde'e. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Jam keewon kash imiru Ik'onat P'ent'eniya eteets P'ilat'os shinatse sheeng amaneyon gawutso Iyesus Krstos shinatse neesh keewiruwe. <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>Nodoonz Iyesus Krstos b́ be'efetsosh t tzaziyan n shelawo shúúts s'ayinon korde'e. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Krstos be'ewonwere, deretsonat b́s'uz altso, naashuwotsatsi naasho, doonzuwotsatsi doonzo bí etts aawotse b́ wotiti, <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Bíwere bíyal k'irawoniye, konuworu bíyok t'inosh b́ falawu shanotse b́ beyiri, bínowere konuworu be'atse, konuworu bek'osh falatse, mangonat dúre dúr angon bísh wotowe, amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Datsanatsi gaaletsuwots bognona bo erawok'o wee bogaal amanek woterawmanats bo te'erawok'o boon azazowe, mank'o bo tewunon noo nogene'uwituwok'o jam keewo bogshede'er noosh imetuwo Ik'o atsats b́wotituwok'o azazowe. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Aaninuwere sheeng fino bofinituwok'o, sheeng finonowere gaaletsi bowotitwok'o, tewud doonat bodetstso kayiyosh k'andek'tswotsi bowotituwok'o azazowe. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Mank'oon arik wotts kasho daatsosh s'ap'dek'k wotts gaalo weyiru duratse botokish kakudek'etunee.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>T'imotiwoso! adaron neesh imetso korde'e, dan woterawo «Dan» ariru koton ooshiyatse wokowe. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Ik ikuwots mannaari dano detsfone ett boamants weeratse k'aztuurne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Ik'i s'aatoniye itnton wotowe.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
